{"id":"schluss","lemma":"Schluss","pos":"noun","rank":591,"glosses":["end, ending, conclusion, finish","logical conclusion"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/69/De-Schluss.ogg/De-Schluss.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Schlusses","plural":"Schlüsse"},"formAudio":{"Schlüsse":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Natschoba-Schl%C3%BCsse.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Warum sollten sie Schluss machen?","en":"Why should they stop?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"Machst du mit mir Schluss?","en":"Are you breaking up with me?","words":[{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},null]},{"text":"Heißt das, du willst Schluss machen?","en":"Does that mean you want to break up?","words":[{"g":"to have a name","l":"heißen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},null,{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"Wir haben Schluss gemacht.","en":"We broke up.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/767530","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},null,{"g":"to make","l":"machen"}]},{"text":"Ich will keine voreiligen Schlüsse ziehen.","en":"I don't want to jump to any conclusions.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"heady","l":"voreilig"},null,{"g":"to pull"}]}]}